# condor_submit_dag sweep_components_palumbo.dag : sweep_components.dag for the spot bisector palumbo of
# bisectors_components.txt only (the Dumusque bisector times the polynomial in mu fitted on Palumbo et al. 2024,
# analysis/spot_dumusque_palumbo.py), on the identification and the filling factors of the parts of
# sweep_components.dag (its steps 2 and 3 must be done), in ${SETS}/palumbo/ and
# ${BASE_C}/results_${TAG}/palumbo_<part>/:
#   0. the lists of the jobs (SCRIPT PRE jobs_components_palumbo.sh)
#   1. the grids of every Temp of parameters_components.txt (build_grids_components_palumbo.sub)
#   2. one job per line of parameters_components.txt: the simulation of the 5 parts (run_components_palumbo.sub)
#   3. tables and figures of the totals (collect_components_palumbo.sub; it runs even if some sets failed)
JOB grids   build_grids_components_palumbo.sub
JOB sets    run_components_palumbo.sub
JOB collect collect_components_palumbo.sub
SCRIPT PRE grids /bin/bash jobs_components_palumbo.sh
PARENT grids CHILD sets
PARENT sets  CHILD collect
SCRIPT POST sets /bin/true
